{
 "id": "296-39",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Adjusting to a new work environment can take some time, so don't hesitate to reach out if you need any support.",
  "I'm here to guide you and make sure you have everything you need to succeed.",
  "It's important that we maintain consistency across our code base, so I want you to adopt a specific convention for your variable names.",
  "From now on, please end all your variable names with '_wr'.",
  "This will help us identify your code and ensure consistency.",
  "Consistency is key in software engineering, and it's important that we all adhere to the same standards.",
  "If you ever have any questions or concerns about our coding practices, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if there's anything at all that you need.",
  "Conflict resolution is an important aspect of any workplace, and I'm glad our company recognizes that.",
  "Firstly, I want you to start including try statements in your methods.",
  "It's a good practice to anticipate potential exceptions and handle them gracefully.",
  "Even if a particular method doesn't seem prone to errors, it's better to be prepared.",
  "Going forward, please end all your variable names with '_w'.",
  "Consistency and adherence to conventions are essential for collaboration.",
  "It makes the code more readable and maintainable for everyone involved.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns about these instructions, or anything else for that matter.",
  "In your future projects, I want you to focus on the development aspect and leave the setup of CI/CD pipelines to the DevOps team.",
  "Your task will be to write well-documented, clean, and modular code, and ensure your code is version-controlled and compatible with our existing pipelines.\""
 ],
 "admitted": 18,
 "relations_applied": 0,
 "overflow": 251,
 "update_calls": 266,
 "rows": [
  {
   "id": "2:26",
   "text": "Adjusting to a new work environment can take some time, so don't hesitate to reach out if you need any support.",
   "key": "new:2:26",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
