   "span_start": 26
  },
  {
   "id": "2:138",
   "text": "I'm here to guide you and make sure you have everything you need to succeed.",
   "key": "new:2:138",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 2,
   "span_start": 138
  },
  {
   "id": "3:41",
   "text": "It's important that we maintain consistency across our code base, so I want you to adopt a specific convention for your variable names.",
   "key": "new:3:41",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 3,
   "span_start": 41
  },
  {
   "id": "3:177",
   "text": "From now on, please end all your variable names with '_wr'.",
   "key": "new:3:177",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 3,
   "span_start": 177
  },
  {
   "id": "4:0",
   "text": "This will help us identify your code and ensure consistency.",
   "key": "new:4:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 4,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "5:9",
   "text": "Consistency is key in software engineering, and it's important that we all adhere to the same standards.",
   "key": "new:5:9",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 5,
   "span_start": 9
  },
  {
   "id": "5:114",
   "text": "If you ever have any questions or concerns about our coding practices, don't hesitate to reach out.",
   "key": "new:5:114",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 5,
   "span_start": 114
  },
  {
   "id": "6:126",
   "text": "Don't hesitate to reach out if there's anything at all that you need.",
   "key": "new:6:126",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 6,
   "span_start": 126
  },
  {
   "id": "7:0",
   "text": "Conflict resolution is an important aspect of any workplace, and I'm glad our company recognizes that.",
   "key": "new:7:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 7,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "10:16",
   "text": "Firstly, I want you to start including try statements in your methods.",
   "key": "new:10:16",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 10,
   "span_start": 16
  },
  {
   "id": "10:87",
   "text": "It's a good practice to anticipate potential exceptions and handle them gracefully.",
   "key": "new:10:87",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 10,
   "span_start": 87
  },
  {
   "id": "10:171",
   "text": "Even if a particular method doesn't seem prone to errors, it's better to be prepared.",
   "key": "new:10:171",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 10,
   "span_start": 171
  },
  {
   "id": "11:94",
   "text": "Going forward, please end all your variable names with '_w'.",
   "key": "new:11:94",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 11,
   "span_start": 94
  },
  {
   "id": "12:9",
   "text": "Consistency and adherence to conventions are essential for collaboration.",
   "key": "new:12:9",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 12,
   "span_start": 9
  },
  {
   "id": "12:83",
   "text": "It makes the code more readable and maintainable for everyone involved.",
   "key": "new:12:83",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 12,
   "span_start": 83
  },
  {
   "id": "13:16",
   "text": "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns about these instructions, or anything else for that matter.",
   "key": "new:13:16",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 13,
   "span_start": 16
  },
  {
   "id": "15:108",
   "text": "In your future projects, I want you to focus on the development aspect and leave the setup of CI/CD pipelines to the DevOps team.",
   "key": "new:15:108",
   "scope": "MAIN",
